  "scenes": [
    {
      "narration": "pH嚴格定義使用氫離子活性。稀、近理想水溶液常用濃度近似。差一個pH單位，代表活性相差十倍；溫度與校正條件也要說明。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "pH是對數，不是線性刻度",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step1",
          "text": "pH＝−log a(H⁺)",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 330,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step2",
          "text": "稀溶液近似：−log[H₃O⁺]",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 453,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step3",
          "text": "差1 pH → 相差10倍",
          "x": 190,
          "y": 576,
          "size": 68,
          "font": "hand",
          "anim": "write"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "độ pH · 酸鹼值",
          "x": 180,
          "y": 265,
          "size": 34,
          "at": 0.5,
          "color": "blue",
          "font": "cute",
          "anim": "write",
          "jitter": 0
        }
      ],
      "hold": 1.3,
      "center": false,
      "min_dur": 0
    },
    {
      "narration": "已知氫離子濃度，求pH。已知氫氧根濃度，先求pOH，再用水的離子積連接。二十五度的入門近似，pH加pOH等於十四；別把十四當成任何溫度都固定。",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "heading",
          "text": "酸與鹼，各走自己的那條路",
          "x": 170,
          "y": 145,
          "size": 86,
          "font": "marker",
          "anim": "write",
          "at": 0.15
        },
        {
